<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-10-20T07:48:38.457Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 07:48:38 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;China’s ambassador was summoned after a Chinese official warned of using force, prompting Philippine lawmakers to demand an apology and a review of water-cannon rules. Vice Admiral Rommel Supangan assumed command of the Philippine Coast Guard and led a rescue of four people, including a child, on Hagonoy Island, Surigao del Sur. Chinese coast guard and navy vessels entered waters near the Pratas Islands and Scarborough Shoal, while Taiwan’s coast guard and maritime forces repelled sixteen mainland Chinese ships in a coordinated operation. The United States and the Philippines conducted their sixteenth bilateral maritime exercise in the West Philippine Sea, and there were 176 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxQZWF3dm9yRFBJNE4xRE5mT0xXT2gyNjRYUENtSHZkS1ppYVNpOGhGNzh6Q2xWT0JPSFpKRjVHdXgxc25Rd0hRSXk1LW5XdmlzdTFQMXQwVkpDZHFXZXRWSlFBUkx2RnNCTktvbEktX0JNeXdsT1l6QzRveGNBQ21rc3ZPM1l0cXE5dlc1NVQ1cExFdzUyd2l4MDRMdk5zWi0wSmdNYkRrRWZzWjg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nikkei Asia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxNYzAxTzlWM1Rhdzd6YmhCQWVQVFk1X1A0WEEwQWI3Sll3X09UQk4wdjhBc0ZmZGN5STc2bDRNb213emRScU55aEQ0ZDV3cEVaXzhfcWdDaFpjYTFoRm1US3hQWmtMYnZhdnNYQ25WeVNLZ3J2MmZ1S2JmUmp6WXJGb1dITWdtdEJRc2sycnFBOFdGSzd4dDVXR3NQOFBlUHplWEp0NjFENU5kZFk?oc=5&quot;&gt;Newswav&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxObW5WSmRoaGswNXgzSlVlYVpOdm1lNDdaQlJpS0JBbGZJZkR6MFlpSU9KazhQRXljYTFXWFlieEZOTGNxUFlsRVJaLTZGYjdnaHIyYnNRYXdoTlZCWExoYmV5bUZUMG1zWmNQdXZnZTlPVkNjbmczWC03NHRtZVVhR1VHckthY1A2d2VxTk16ZmlUUmJpakVMakpGLUw3NkZpWjdpamxrTjF4RzFhUktaMEhxRU1CUUk?